  "accepted_facts": [
    "One canonical core candidate value/enum and Vec resource can represent the proven value contract. Six tags0..5; tag1 usize index; tag2 bool plus preserved unknown u32; quaternion4, translation3, scale3, stable hash u64 and WallId u64. No guessed raw pointers/Arc/String ownership.",
