    "Resource empty Vec is a proven original constructor in ClutterPlugin, not evidence of a successful collected window. The same type must be shared by blueprint collector and actual drain consumer.",
    "V2 correctly distinguishes recurring outputs from visual rebuilding. Same-Arc and different-Arc/fullEq-equal current blueprints still contribute candidates before the rebuild decision; later flag0 only skips equality/rebuild.",
    "Actual consumer drains immediately, resolves the same ClutterMeshes owner, uses quaternion*Z and translation, preserves separate key/WallId and shutter payload/side inversion. Index failure stays observable; tag6 is a drain-loop terminator, not valid seventh variant.",
    "PDB canonical namespaces and inline eq source associations support placement without inventing original author fields, repr or ABI. Existing-file newer edits on another machine remain possible; finite missing-file snapshots do not rule them out."
  ],
  "implementation_requirements": [
    "Preserve recurring candidate/WallHoles/other pre-rebuild outputs outside the visual changed gate. Tests must run same-Arc collector twice separated by real drains: outputs recur; physical persistent entity does not re-spawn solely for collection.",
    "Use one canonical Resource/Component type at every producer/collector/consumer. Remove the separate manually assembled OnWindowInput mirror when that actual consumer is restored.",
    "Use capacity-preserving drain and the actual AutoClutterState/catalog mesh output; do not replace with placeholder prefab strings, empty resources, default shapes, unconditional clearing or a second candidate route.",
    "Preserve exact scalar key/hash and external per-wall id. Preserve shutter unknown native_u32_04 bits without relabeling its business meaning.",
    "Real window producers remain separately owned restoration work. No claim that tag0 writer or every inlined/static writer has been recovered.",
    "Only root may authorize source additions in the existing canonical namespace and integrate all necessary owners. This report authorizes no production change."
  ],
